<title>FINLAND: RAUTARUUKKI SAYS WINS FIM 300 MLN ORDER.</title>
<headline>RAUTARUUKKI SAYS WINS FIM 300 MLN ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy said on Thursday it had won a two-year ship steel order deal worth almost 300 million markka from Norwegian shipbuilder Kvaerner's Finnish shipyard Kvaerner Masa-Yards Oy.</p>
<p>&quot;The agreement covers steel supplies from 1997 to 1998,&quot; Rautaruukki said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
</text>
